                    "answer": {
                      "short": "A weighted network with the eight roads shown in the solution diagram; weights are in minutes.",
                      "worked": "Draw one vertex for each town and one undirected edge for each direct road. The diagonal zeros do not represent loops. There are no edges $AE$ or $CD$.",
                      "provenance": {
                        "short": "authored",
                        "worked": "authored"
                      },
                      "solutionDiagrams": [
                        {
                          "id": "p44-q8-network-solution",
                          "format": "tikz",
                          "widthMm": 85,
                          "role": "solution",
                          "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
                          "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"source page 44 p44-q8-network-solution\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont},line cap=round,line join=round]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\coordinate (A) at (0,2);\\coordinate (B) at (4,3);\\coordinate (C) at (0,0);\\coordinate (D) at (2,4.5);\\coordinate (E) at (4,0);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (A)--node[pos=.42,above,sloped] {$50$}(B);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (A)--node[left] {$18$}(C);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (A)--node[above left] {$10$}(D);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (B)--node[pos=.7,below,sloped] {$28$}(C);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (B)--node[above right] {$32$}(D);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (B)--node[right] {$20$}(E);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (C)--node[below] {$50$}(E);\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (D) to[bend left=48] node[pos=.45,right] {$80$}(E);\n\\foreach \\v in {A,B,C,D,E}{\\fill (\\v) circle (2pt);}\n\\node[left=4pt] at (A) {$A$};\\node[above right=4pt] at (B) {$B$};\\node[below left=4pt] at (C) {$C$};\\node[above=4pt] at (D) {$D$};\\node[below right=4pt] at (E) {$E$};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
                          "spec": {
                            "sourcePage": 44,
                            "sourceRegion": "Question 8 travelling-time table",
                            "description": "Undirected weighted network reconstructed from the native table. Crossing edges have no vertex. All eight roads are retained; diagonal zeros create no loops.",
